OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused claimed woman found
OL,4,Ain freezer was alive
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of murdering a woman
OL,7,Fwhose dismembered body was found in a
OL,8,Ffreezer, came up with "fantasies" about
OL,9,Fher living in Australia, his cousin has
OL,10,Ftold court.
OL,12,FGeorge Gordon, from Gerards Court in St
OL,13,FHelens is accused of murdering his
OL,14,Ffriend Delia McInerney who was 62, in
OL,15,FApril 2023.
OL,17,FGordon, 65, who appeared in the dock at
OL,18,FLiverpool Crown Court for the first
OL,19,Ftime on Thursday, has admitted killing
OL,20,FDelia but claims it was self defence
OL,21,Fand denies her murder.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
