OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused claimed woman found
OL,4,Ain freezer was alive
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Lawler, the defendant's cousin,
OL,7,Ftold the jury that Gordon and Delia
OL,8,Fwere like "business partners and
OL,9,Fsoulmates", who regularly visited art
OL,10,Fgalleries and went on holiday together.
